{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:daf534563ce7c47305fd021d81bd0234edc190915882667328282d6d58f6c434",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9617a3e41879b2c046b1ea3c272ab486d7f0f7fbe6c5860b9a40d1cf305e69b0",
      "text": "晚上好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天谢谢您送来的美好祝福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1be53a495c083b8a3f97b85e9db7e7736d25d025f8402bddaf35badde95e4177",
      "text": "丽先生演奏的《春》，旋律真的很优美呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d874f043d1a196f42b5afc3c45a711fbe511ba1f998ecafae1a53a7d30d0e2f1",
      "text": "令人感动",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb0d755b2b5c0435539e21f19fbede13f9220577126a882a17aa967183736e90",
      "text": "选曲非常棒呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9316508747dc27aca30659a06ab7e102011c40df00fc345d6d00f8993aa2a8e6",
      "text": "是啊。能深切感受到丽先生融入音符中的心意，\n真是一场扣人心弦的演奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd480f0f939afb36466a5a1a78d0f26e5a02fb14610013ec792d9068938dd0b0",
      "text": "我还是头一次觉得，\n能出生在春天真是太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:367ca771c14d6b2ce68b99cc3dd2f2d3877ed1a2e592c7d688e9b3d97e3736d6",
      "text": "还有，也谢谢制作人\n为我准备了蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f44f1a9d0f6bd705147e2c38cb721cfb20f6f00d982ade6d2f2b1f857221ac9a",
      "text": "非常爽口美味哦。我能感受到，\n这一定是你们两位为我细心挑选的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9819011b0fff9982d2b0a7acbb959cda383b86b14ce39c0565daf9a9f9eded",
      "text": "能合您的口味\n真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8405764049e280469dcf2341b11ce364e2f223adeca36d3ce2c2fc821121173",
      "text": "能度过如此特别的一天，\n多亏了你们二位为我做足了准备呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65a410c2ce4a8cf60ae2ab2407c1b4a8cdbbdb0b27580ae0c4aec526bea85b9b",
      "text": "今年的这个生日，我想我一定终生难忘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_22_t01:1_2_007_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:072a4841d297ba0d6abf3b15bf89aeeb64b96297f5302b583798e3192aa24833",
      "text": "今天总觉得，能做个美梦呢。\n那么，晚安。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
